NVIDIA OptiX SDK headers
https://github.com/NVIDIA/optix-dev
The extension is compiled against the OptiX 8.1 SDK headers and embeds OptiX
device programs (PTX) generated from RayD sources with them. No OptiX library is
shipped: the OptiX runtime is part of the NVIDIA display driver and is loaded
from the driver at run time when available. The headers are
Copyright (c) NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES and are subject to the NVIDIA
OptiX SDK license.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NVIDIA CUDA libraries
The extension links the CUDA runtime (libcudart) and cuSOLVER dynamically. No
CUDA library is shipped in this package; they come from the CUDA build of
PyTorch and the NVIDIA driver at run time.

